# STATE.md — {{product-name}}

> **How to use:** instantiated once in F0 from this template
> (`Maestro/workflows/W00-project-kickoff.md`) and then **always updated**, at the end of
> each block of work — never just "at the end of the day" (a session that does not update this
> is half-lost work). Lives at the **project root**. It is the first file to read after
> `CLAUDE.md`.

---

*Hygiene: the top stays hyper-detailed about the present; old sessions collapse into §Historical log by
milestone (the detail lives in Git/CHANGELOG). A STATE.md where nobody can find anything has
stopped being memory (`Maestro/core/project-memory.md` §Memory hygiene).*

