## 8. Debt

*Technical debt **accepted knowingly** — not everything left undone, only what was decided to
carry, with an owner and a trigger for paying it. This is what stops reviewers and guardians
from re-flagging, cycle after cycle, something already accepted (`loops/L08-technical-debt.md`).*

- **{{debt}}.** Accepted on {{yyyy-mm-dd}} because: {{reason}}. Owner: {{who}}. Pay when:
  {{concrete trigger}}.

